{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "5b0f7e3a-2c1d-4e9b-8a51-aibriefings0001",
    "name": "ScaleSerum — AI Briefings",
    "description": "The Briefings page: All, Sales Team, Ads & Marketing, WhatsApp and Leads, one stored briefing per brand and day.\n\nSETUP\n1. Start the API:  PORT=3011 python app.py\n2. Open this collection's Variables tab and paste your API_KEY (from .env) into `apiKey`.\n3. Run the whole collection IN ORDER. Request 2 generates DI's yesterday with real scrumdb data and real Gemini (about 30 s); request 3 polls until it is done; the rest read it back.\n\nWHAT TO LOOK FOR\nAds: blended ROAS is payments received / spend (never 0x from empty platform revenue), and campaign ROAS is labelled Meta-reported. Requests 13-17 check viewer scoping: a rep without team view sees only their own row and only their tabs.\n\nGeneration writes only this service's own MongoDB collections (ai_briefings, ai_briefing_runs). scrumdb is read-only.",
